{
  "functions": {
    "api/ai.js": { "maxDuration": 60 }
  },
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-cache" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/index.html",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-cache" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/sw.js",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-cache" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/manifest.json",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "IR全文與AI分析：內容只在該公司出新一季法說會時才變動，可長時間快取。用 stale-while-revalidate 讓使用者先看到既有內容、背景再更新，不會有等待感。這裡與報價不同，即使短暫拿到前一版也不會顯示錯誤數字（季度標示本身就在內容裡）。",
      "source": "/data/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=600, s-maxage=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
